note bay 5 review of b203fc8c (same class as x-sleepneg): execenv with a well-formed program packet and an environment packet
note holding an empty record traps 3 before any kernel call (OMEGESE s10); ngrun refuses execenv (115) after it.
fn main to int
a = new uchar 5 0
put a 0 1
put a 2 1
put a 4 120
b = new uchar 4 0
put b 0 1
k = execenv a 0 5 b 0 4
ret int and k 255
end
